at.md","size_bytes":4118},"commits":{"digest":"ee4ab21bb1e0707c4ab6ca555eecfb1ffc15ee3db95eeaf45a76aa411a33c0ea","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kd.1/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kd.1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"1ea089173b3df002d04f4ccb9f6318ab0607ea9b303212e2190233d50d66ab50","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kd.1/meta.json","size_bytes":7427},"prompt":{"digest":"d2a0136505c97e5f57f17174acedf577ca4dee44609f60c570560af6b876906a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kd.1/prompt.md","size_bytes":183},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"0ef6dbc4f7f5b016d023f87fabddba092ead7cfde2f51ec9d4c6f58dc8ed3cb5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kd.1/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":6394},"state":{"digest":"64b587d574f97367c3ba305c1c3e915d9ae7eeb2fac8fdf4cc8ac78a657f496e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kd.1/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-11-11T16:35:03.342522+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kd.1","local_name":"bob-cli-kd.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-kd","agent_clan_generation":"20261111112632","bead_id":"bob-cli-kd.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-kd[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Bank — acknowledge every transaction daily, prove it weekly[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Bryan restarts his daily bank habit right away. Every posted [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]transaction and deposit becomes one checkbox row in a monthly bank [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]note under a new `bank` sub-area of `cash`. Typing a row [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]acknowledges it. A weekly `bob bank import` of a Wells Fargo QFX [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]file writes, unchecked, only the rows he missed, and a balance [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]proof shows that nothing was skipped. Every total is computed when [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]it is drawn (terminal, month card, queue card, daily chip) and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]never written into notes. A missed week costs one sitting to catch [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]up, not a retyping spiral.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bank_daily_acknowledgment.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/bank_daily_acknowledgment.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-kd[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-kd/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Restart the habit in the vault with no code[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]bank-restart[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank-restart: create `bank.md` under `cash` with its `bank:` config, the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`bank_month` type note, and this month's bank month note in the final [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]template. Capture the daily PRE chore, retire the decaying [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`^daily-bank-records-again` as superseded, and gate on link and task [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]counts.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The bank module, row grammar, and bob bank check[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bank-grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank-grammar: add `src/native/bank/` with the `bank:` config parser [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](key-path diagnostics), the row and day-heading grammar, the canonical [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]renderers and insertion planners, and the month-note scanner. Ship the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]read-only `bob bank check` lint in the Integrations section, and write [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`docs/bank.md` as the contract.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Read the bank — list, report, ensure, and ack[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bank-cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bank-grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank-cli: add the bare `bob bank` waiting queue, `report` with the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]totals semantics, and two capture-style guarded writes: `ensure` (month [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]note and day heading) and `ack` (tick shown rows). Give each beautiful [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]human output and `schema_version: 1` JSON, with account status stubbed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]as `unverified`.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Weekly QFX import that writes only what you missed[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]bank-import[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bank-cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank-import: parse Wells Fargo QFX (OFX 1.x SGML and 2.x XML) plus one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CSV profile; resolve accounts without numbers; journal hashed identities[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per host; match typed rows; name rows from rules, learned payees, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]restaurant records; write unchecked rows in one guarded, committed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]transaction with an exact dry run; add the weekly PRE chore.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prove every transaction — coverage, presence, balance[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bank-balance[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bank-import[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank-balance: derive each account's anchor from the bank's own numbers, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prove coverage, presence, and balance, report possible twins, unmatched [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]typed rows, and edited amounts, and fill account status in check, list, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]report, and import. Add `import -F` to restore deleted rows [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deliberately.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Obsidian bank cards, styled rows, and the daily chip[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]bank-obsidian[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bank-cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank-obsidian: in bob-ledger-tools, draw the `bob-bank` month and queue [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cards, style bank rows and day headings, add the quiet daily-note chip, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the open-today and acknowledge commands, Enter continuation with `- \\[x] [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]$`, and category suggestions. Guard bank rows against task gestures, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]then `bob plugins sync`.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end proof, the guide, docs audit, memory, and [/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]follow-ups[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]bank-wrapup[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bank-restart, bank-balance, bank-obsidian[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank-wrapup: walk every bank gesture end to end in a temporary vault, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]write the how-to guide, audit every bank doc against shipped behaviour, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]check the real vault, apply only the accepted memory decisions, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]propose the subscriptions album (blocked on bob-cli-k3) and the later [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]views as follow-ups.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-kd","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-kd.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-ce0b8185ee0c4f031e3f9bb94e395bd5","started_at":"2026-11-11T16:28:04.458598+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"1c7d8b66325570d32eb850420fa09a2eddf33c9b559639598a602e332df882df","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kd.4/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"0df30200af0d5d9aaf91cececa969c801182dd9f2e2373e117ba86b04c287a1a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kd.4/meta.json","size_bytes":689},"prompt":{"digest":"8618001b87be38380f905f02d55c96991b89821d81dc2f229b2d1f7e044630f2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kd.4/prompt.md","size_bytes":181},"state":{"digest":"95ed6d2c28f958ab0fbbcef65a20c9c09f89e0a0e7d17d4714bede28832c946b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kd.4/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kd.4","local_name":"bob-cli-kd.4","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-kd","agent_clan_generation":"20261111112632","bead_id":"bob-cli-kd.4","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-kd","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-astra","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-kd.4","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads":["bob-cli-kd.3"]},"source_run_id":"run-d27aa84e69caea10a830134ffd0c6b96","started_at":"20261111112635","state":"waiting"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{